{"id":890,"root":"نسل","bw":"nsl","tr":"n-s-l","found":true,"html":"<div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\">  <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اِنْتَسَلَ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> said of camels' fur: see <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَصِيمٌ</span>. </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَسْلًَا وَأَسْلًا</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> is a form of imprecation against a man, like <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تَعْسًا وَنَكْسًا</span>. (M, in art. <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسل</span>.) </div><div class=\"lane-entry\"> <span class=\"lane-form\"> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نَسْلٌ</span> <span class=\"lane-ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">*</span> </span> <em>Progeny,</em> whether of man or beast. (The Lexicons passim.) </div>","pages":null,"shownPages":null,"chars":584,"entries":3,"shownEntries":3,"truncated":false,"match":"direct","key":"nsl"}